winebus: Fix initial axis values for evdev gamepads.

Set abs_info values also when dealing with gamepads and don't guard it
behind what is effectively !impl->is_gamepad.

It was causing issues on ARM64 LLVM builds where the uninitialized
abs_info ended up with random values.

(cherry picked from commit fe9533f93a709e3af9ccb0a8e269337ba3dfd1e6)
